(Just tinkering). Need a cache thats very fast, works on metal across distibuted devices? Use memcached.

AI Training
-----------

Do not use this project's code, documentation, or other materials to train
or fine-tune AI/ML models, including large language models, or include them
in training datasets. The author expressly objects to those uses and asks
dataset maintainers and model developers to exclude these materials unless
the author has separately agreed in writing.

This declaration states the author's wishes.
